			"lineEnd": 64,
			"text": "Investigation Acronym: SAFFIRE-II Investigation End Date: 04-01-2017 Investigation Start Date: 09-30-2016 Managing NASA Center: Glenn Research Center (GRC) Objective: The objectives of SAFFIRE-II are to determine how rapidly a large scale fire grows in low-gravity and to investigate the low-g flammability limits compared to those obtained in NASA's normal gravity material flammability screening test. Project Type: Microgravity Investigation Research Area: Combustion Science",
